# Lesson icon library — raw source images (intermediate inputs only).
# The finished base64-embedded SVGs in assets/lesson-icons/ ARE committed;
# these large source PNGs are not, to keep the repo and git history lean.
# Path-anchored rules do NOT match nested folders: the real path is
# assets/lesson-icons/science/<cycle>/_source/. A leading **/ matches at any depth.
**/_source/

# Power-Up image staging — the order-check contact sheet written by
# tools/powerup-images.py --stage. It is a throwaway review artifact,
# regenerated on demand, and lives in img/ where the real assets go.
_STAGE-check-order.png

